Package: qa-dashboard
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: qa-sentinels (>= 1.1.0)
Description: Electron desktop dashboard for QA Sentinels
 QA Dashboard is a graphical front end for the QA Sentinels command-line
 tool. It reads status, findings, tickets, logs and the Sentinels SQLite
 database through fixed read-only `qa` calls.
 .
 The package bundles Electron and depends on the qa-sentinels APT package.
 The first use of the Sentinels CLI initializes a per-user workspace at
 ~/QA-Sentinels; an existing checkout is never overwritten.
